the protagonist of the movie is yamabi  takuya a 27 year old man who lives in a  tiny apartment in tokyo alongside his  wife yukari takuya is a web designer by  profession and spends his entire day at  home working on different projects on  the other hand yukari works at a  hospital as a nurse and usually arrives  late at home in this way the lives of  the couple are completely contrasting  takuya doesn't get to go out while  yukari doesn't get to spend much time at  home one night as takuya is busy with  one of his projects yukari arrives home  tired and demands food takuhi was  supposed to prepare dinner but since he  was engrossed in his work he forgot  about it now seeing his wife angry he  gets scared and decides to order food  from his usual delivery app however when  he opens the app it sends a notice that  food deliveries will take a bit more  time due to a large volume of requests  as a result he decides against using the  app he then browses through the app  store for another delivery app and comes  across a new one called otodokemono  strangely the description of the app  mentions that it can deliver the  products in just two seconds as expected  takuya doesn't believe it and thinks it  is a joke but since his wife is hungry  and can attack him at any time he  decides to give otodokimono a try he  orders two cheeseburgers which have  normal rates but the delivery charge is  a bit high at 800 yen we all know that  burned takuya still he finalizes the  order and waits for the delivery  surprisingly the doorbell rings  instantly and on opening a beautiful  girl walks in she is wearing the  otodokimono cap and has the delivery  parcel in her hands taken aback tokuya  questions the girl if she is carrying  the right order but the latter just  hands him the parcel and leaves in the  next scene a still confused takuya  examines the burgers to verify their  authenticity after a bit of sniffing he  concludes that the burgers are real and  that the order is correct just then  yukari comes out of the shower and is  excited to see that the food has arrived  so early takuya mentions that it arrived  in just two seconds but yukari believes  that he said it metaphorically she then  starts devouring the burger and to  takuya's surprise it tastes delicious  later as yukari is doing her evening  facial she notices that her moisturizer  has run out once again she gets angry at  takuya because it was his job to order  the new stuff she chastises him for  failing to do the household chores  despite being at home all day just then  an idea strikes takuya's mind he opens  the otodokemono app and types in the  word moisturizer surprisingly the  product is available and takuya orders  it immediately once again the doorbell  rings instantly and the same girl  delivers the product was she just  hanging out outside the door witnessing  this yukari is left speechless and she  finally believes her husband after the  surreal discovery the couple start  ordering from the app every day they buy  all kinds of stuff food clothes kitchen  items even toilet rolls with time  passing by their lives become heavily  dependent on the otodokimono app one day  the two order some steak and when it  arrives takuya is stunned to find out  that it is from beef and peas american  steakhouse it turns out that there is no  such restaurant in japan and the food  was delivered from the states itself  with this the couple realizes that the  app can even bring them stuff from  different parts of the world they then  decide to make a list of the other  supernatural items that can be delivered  to them at first they try 1 million yen  in cash but the total charge comes out  to be 1 million and 800 yen the  additional 800 being the delivery charge  then they try the iconic one piece's  great treasure but the search engine  sends an error mentioning that the typed  keyword is invalid and they'll have to  watch a thousand episodes first  following this yukari tries a  teleportation door but the search engine  says no results found in this way one by  one all the couple's fantasies are  declined but just then yukari comes up  with an idea she types in the wedding  ring that takuya lost a year ago and  surprisingly the item is available  what's more surprising is the fact that  the total price of the item is still  only 800 yen which is the delivery  charge with this the couple deduces that  the ring takuya bought her was knock off  crap just kidding the couple deduces  that the app can also find lost items  and if it's an item that they already  owned there are no additional costs  wasting no time yukari immediately  places the order and the same girl  arrives at the door in two seconds she  hands them the ring which is exactly the  one that takuya had lost a year ago  following this yukari gets another idea  she types in the word meow which is the  name of her dog she lost 10 years ago  when she was a teenager you'd think  she'd call it bark the plan works and  the app is able to locate the dog in no  time the product is delivered but  strangely it comes inside a box the  couple open it nervously and instead of  a dog they find a pot there they find  the rotting bones of meow and realized  that the dog died long ago despite this  yukari is not willing to give up on her  long-lost friend so she types in the  keyword meow but in a live condition and  orders it surprisingly the dog is  delivered in the same condition that it  was lost in 10 years ago takuya is left  speechless by the phenomenon as he  realizes that the app can also deliver  things from the past in the next scene  yukari is at the hospital she visits one  of her patients mr tsukimoto who seems  to be searching for his watch yukari  approaches him and mentions that he  didn't have any watch when he was  brought in and mr tsukimoto finally  calms down she then advises him to buy a  new one when he is discharged from the  hospital but mr tsukimoto gets angry and  lashes out at her telling her that the  watch was gifted by his late wife as a  keepsake hearing this yukari starts  reminiscing about her dying mother sauri  who had also handed her a locket as a  keepsake the mother expressed her last  wish to see yukari getting married but  the wish was never fulfilled as she  passed away just a few days later i do  not like where this is going at night an  emotional yukari opens the otodokimono  app and types in the words my mother's  salary in healthy condition oh boy  seeing this takuya gets scared and tries  to stop his wife as he believes that the  dead should not be disturbed however  being the stubborn girl that she is  yukari does not listen and proceeds with  the order shockingly the billing amount  totals around 167 million yen despite  this yukari presses the order option but  nothing happens it turns out that the  app will not deliver the things that are  out of the couple's budget the next day  takuya scrolls through the internet and  reads about a famous baseball player  getting married he then types in the  name of the same baseball player in the  otto dokimono app and learns that his  price is around 3.7 billion yen with  this he finds out that a person's worth  is the entire income that they have  earned in their lifetime meanwhile  yukari who is still distraught that she  cannot meet her mother approaches takuya  and tells him that they should stop  using the app being the sensible husband  that he is takuya agrees without saying  a word he should just search jeff bezos  and the apple implode cut to a few  months later the duo has now resumed  their normal lives one day takuya is at  the cinema waiting for his wife to  arrive he soon gets bored and calls  yukari to know about her location when  she mentions that she has just left the  hospital takuya becomes impatient he  then orders the forbidden app and enters  his wife's name to check her worth  surprisingly she is absolutely free and  only the delivery charge is included  here takuya remembers the ring which was  also free since he owned it he then  realizes that though he does not own  yukari since he's not andrew tate she is  still his wife and that makes her his  responsibility after the realization  takuya immediately orders his wife and  bam she's there in the blink of an eye  with this the two start exploiting this  feature of the app more often whenever  yukari finishes her shift at the  hospital takuya just orders her so that  she doesn't have to board the crowded  train they even go on overseas vacations  using the same technique which saves  them a lot of money and time in this way  the couple start living the best  versions of their lives and become very  close to one another in the next scene  yukari surprises mr tsukimoto with his  long-lost watch making him excited he  then promises to help her when she needs  it the most at night it is the couple's  anniversary and takuya has prepared a  lovely dinner for his wife this time he  doesn't teleport her using the app as he  wants to surprise her however when she  doesn't arrive on time he becomes  anxious and calls her he reveals that he  has set up a surprise dinner for her and  asks her to come early but yukari  mentions that she wants to eat at a  french restaurant instead one thing  leads to another and the couple get into  an argument after the call an enraged  takuya opens the otodokimono app and  prepares to order his wife  simultaneously yukari also opens the app  and types in her husband's name they  both press the order option at the same  time and because of a glitch they are  transported to another universe which is  dark and has several doors in it scared  the couple tries to brainstorm several  ways to get out but all of them go in  vain just then takuya takes out his  phone and realizes that it has got  reception he immediately calls one of  his friends and instructs him to  download the same app and type his name  into it however when the friend types in  takuya's name and presses the order  option the total bill comes out to be  200 million yen this is because the  friend does not own takuya so he has to  pay the full amount now with no one to  call for help the couple becomes trapped  in the place forever cut to the next  scene three months have passed and the  couple is still living in the same place  they have used the otodokimono app to  gather all the basic amenities that they  require for living this also includes  the dog takuya is back to his web  designing work but yukari who worked as  a nurse stays idle all day the only  person they meet is the same delivery  girl who works for otedokomono a further  year has passed by and the couple has  started growing distant one day while  takuya is busy with his work meow who  for some reason is still a puppy starts  crying this enrages takuya and he shouts  at the poor puppy he then barges inside  his wife's room revealing that they have  started living separately takuya orders  yukari to take responsibility for the  dog but the latter is uninterested  because of this takuya becomes further  enraged and slaps his wife he quickly  realizes his mistake and tries to  console yukari but she sends him away a  few days later as takuya is working on  his computer an idea comes into his mind  he approaches yukari with a divorce  paper and mentions that if he marries  another girl she can use the app and  order him for free and as soon as he  returns to the real world he will break  up with the girl remarry yukari and  order her back although yukari is  hesitant as she believes that takuya  will betray her and start living with  his new wife she signs the document as  they have no other options the next day  takuya starts his hunt for a suitable  girl he gets a beautiful ring and shows  it to random women online but each one  of them is unwilling to marry him  without meeting him physically upset he  leaves his desk and heads to yukari's  room but surprisingly she is not present  there takuya then searches around the  whole area but yukari is nowhere to be  found he then calls her and gets stunned  to find out that she has returned to the  real world it turns out that she  contacted mr sukamoto for help and he  ordered her via the app by paying the  full amount hopeful that he will now  escape the mysterious place takuya tells  his wife to marry him and order him back  but she refuses instead she mentions  that she is going to marry mr sukamoto  as he is rich and can provide her with a  far better life hearing this takuya is  devastated and he begs his wife to call  him back but she hangs up the call left  with no options takuya opens the  otodokimono app and tries to order his  wife but her new price is over 200  million yen it has been several years  now and takuya is living alone in the  place one day when the delivery girl  arrives with food takuya begs her to  rescue him he says that he would do  anything to get back to the real world  when the girl hears the word anything  she takes him to her workplace which has  thousands of employees who look exactly  like her elsewhere yukari is with mr  tsukimoto and they are living a happy  life the couple also uses the  otodokemono app quite frequently one day  yukari orders a wallpaper for her house  and when the order arrives she is  stunned to see her ex-husband takuya on  the other side with her delivery  subscribe for more videos like this turn  on notifications and leave a like to  help the channel out thank you for  watching

